104 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 57 0 R
/E (The Autonomous Garbage-Collecting Robot with Claw is a low-cost robotic system that will be able to collect small pieces of litter in indoor and semi-indoor environments. The robot is controlled by an Arduino Uno and has two HC-SR04 ultrasonic sensors for wall detection and serpentine lane navigation. Target garbage objects are detected by the IR/ESP32 sensor, and then the robot stops, and the mechanical arm composed of two servos is extended to pick up the garbage and transfer it to the garbage container. The movement is provided by four DC motors that are connected to an L298N motor driver. Weight of the container is monitored by a load cell with the help of HX711 and a buzzer is triggered when the weight reaches. The goal is to lessen the need to collect litter manually, reduce the contact with unhygienic waste, and offer an easy and cheap robotic clean-up solution.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [46]
>>
endobj
