<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 57 0 R
/E (Collecting garbage in communal areas is repetitive, time consuming and unhygienic. The aim of this project is to design an autonomous robot which can move in a controlled area, identify small garbage objects and pick up the garbage with a mechanical claw and store it in an in-board container.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [50]
>>
